WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.758
That evening Jack told Mother about Milky White.

2
00:00:08.759 --> 00:00:11.969
"This is terrible!" Mother said.

3
00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:14.925
"How will we make money?"

4
00:00:14.926 --> 00:00:20.945
She put her head on the table and sobbed.

5
00:00:20.946 --> 00:00:24.307
There was one thing Jack hated.

6
00:00:24.308 --> 00:00:32.571
That was watching Mother cry.

7
00:00:32.572 --> 00:00:35.757
"Please don't cry, Mother," he said.

8
00:00:35.758 --> 00:00:38.342
"I have a plan."

9
00:00:38.343 --> 00:00:40.566
Mother lifted her head.

10
00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:44.340
"We have a big problem, Jack," she said.

11
00:00:44.341 --> 00:00:49.922
"It's not time for one of your grand plans."

12
00:00:49.923 --> 00:00:52.027
Jack smiled.

13
00:00:52.028 --> 00:00:54.913
"It's not a grand plan this time.

14
00:00:54.914 --> 00:00:58.877
It's a simple one."

15
00:00:58.878 --> 00:01:02.606
"What is it?" Mother asked slowly.

16
00:01:02.607 --> 00:01:07.072
"I will look for a job," Jack said.

17
00:01:07.073 --> 00:01:10.741
"Then I can earn money."

18
00:01:10.742 --> 00:01:13.237
"A job?" Mother said.

19
00:01:13.238 --> 00:01:17.153
"Where will you look for a job?"

20
00:01:17.154 --> 00:01:21.084
"I will look in town," Jack said.

21
00:01:21.085 --> 00:01:25.567
"You tried that last year," Mother said.

22
00:01:25.568 --> 00:01:35.312
"Remember, Jack? Nobody needed help."

23
00:01:35.313 --> 00:01:38.583
"That was a year ago," Jack said.

24
00:01:38.584 --> 00:01:41.598
"Maybe someone needs help now."

25
00:01:41.599 --> 00:01:45.602
He shrugged. "It never hurts to try."

26
00:01:45.603 --> 00:01:49.650
Just then something outside caught Jack's eye.

27
00:01:49.651 --> 00:01:56.877
In the night sky, a star twinkled brightly.

28
00:01:56.878 --> 00:02:00.519
Hope filled Jack's heart.

29
00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.835
Jack looked back at Mother.

30
00:02:02.836 --> 00:02:06.232
"I have a good feeling about this, Mother.

31
00:02:06.233 --> 00:02:10.427
Something magical is going to happen."

32
00:02:10.428 --> 00:02:13.069
Mother sighed.

33
00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:17.452
"Fine. Go and look for a job.

34
00:02:17.453 --> 00:02:29.071
Maybe something good will happen."

